WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,670
It seems that these two little guys are on good terms after reconciliation.

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:16,970
Even the arrogant Xue Wu can't resist the young master with Baihuali's formula

3
00:00:16,970 --> 00:00:21,240
Who allowed you to barbecue again?

4
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:25,710
But the price is that the desire is hard to quench, and the appearance is regretful.

5
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:28,740
It is said that Elder Danyangzi is less than 50 years old now

6
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:31,740
He looks just like the laborers from the old motherland in Xinjiang

7
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:37,780
Disciple Master Chu met Elder Danyangzi

8
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:46,220
Disciple Gu Yuan met Elder Danyangzi

9
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:49,220
How come you, a second-level spirit master, have raised so many spirit masters?

10
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:51,220
The disciple is indeed a second-level spiritual master

11
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:52,220
There are only two contracted spirit insects

12
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,220
There are also three spiritual insects that are just smoked and raised.

13
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:56,220
There is no cleaner

14
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:58,220
It costs a lot to smoke and raise spiritual insects.

15
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:01,220
Just raising the contracted spirit beasts is already very burdensome for Xuan Changren.

16
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:03,220
You raise three of them at once

17
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:05,220
I'm willing to give it up
